      },
      "message": "fix(sim): draw a drawn holder profile as drawn\n\nThe viewport simulation drew a drawn (spun) holder as the stepped\ncylinder bands that the collision laws read, and the shank widened to\nthe band at the holder foot. It now draws the drawn outline and the\nstored shank. The checks, the verify step and the post gate are not\nchanged: they read the same landed body, and JudgedOutline::with_drawn\nrefuses an outline or shank that is wider than what the laws read.\n\nFixes #2176\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
